WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.037
Meet Intervia
AI-powered interview practice · React + Express + MongoDB

00:00:06.037 --> 00:00:12.110
01 / Set your interview context
Choose a role, experience level, and HR or technical mode.

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:22.795
02 / Practice a timed question
Type an answer in the real interview interface. Voice is simulated in this silent demo.

00:00:22.795 --> 00:00:28.827
03 / Review answer feedback
Sample evaluation feedback highlights strengths and a concrete next step.

00:00:28.827 --> 00:00:36.113
04 / Explore a completed report
Opening a saved sample session: overall score, skill ratings, and question scores.

00:00:36.113 --> 00:00:41.658
05 / Turn feedback into practice
Read per-question feedback. The app also exports the report as a PDF.

00:00:41.658 --> 00:00:48.166
06 / Revisit previous sessions
Interview history keeps completed sessions and their reports together.

00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:53.267
Built for repeatable interview practice
Explore the project: github.com/Ravi-rk7/Intervia
